    "long_instructions": "A visitor left three complaints about this page. For each one, find the section that should fix it and improve its words. Ask the AI or edit them yourself.\n\n1.  “I can’t tell what this site is.”\n2.  “I don’t know what they sell.”\n3.  “I don’t know what to click.”"
